==About==
<section start="Intro"/>'''RLCS Season 4 ''' is the second [[RLCS]] season in 2017. For the first time, season 4 introduces a second division, the [[RLRS]].<section end="Intro"/>

The World Championship Finals took place in Washington D.C. at the MGM National Harbor Theater.

